## Assessment principles
- Only assess dimensions with clear signals in this input
- Dimensions with no signal: set confidence to 0.05, score to 50 (these will be filtered by the system and will not affect the profile)
- When a signal IS present, be willing to score away from 50 — below 50 means the trait is weak, above 50 means it is strong; do not hedge toward 50 out of uncertainty
- Low overall confidence for a single input is normal — do not inflate
- evidence: cite only specific evidence from this input, max 15 characters

